{"title":"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/4/5141b3b0adedf8965c49060e697689e88f77f6b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\not=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/f/67f124ec89baa0b89a0f0f03622619fa3a301a0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y\\not=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/2/d728fa56f484f9d4a64224d6a61b657819f9e07a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{x}+\\frac{3}{y}=\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"86\" height=\"41\" /> is equivalent to\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/e/76e1ec77bbfbc860e9037c36b8b57cbad2ba0cf3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)\\ } 4x+3y=xy \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }y=\\frac{4x}{6-y} \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\  } \\frac{x}{2}+\\frac{y}{3}=2 \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"431\" height=\"40\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/b/a6b7ffa29ada306edc990271167cb652de5683c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(D) \\  } \\frac{4y}{y-6}=x \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\  }\\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"276\" height=\"42\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>To clear out the fractions, we multiply both sides of the equation by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/7/3f79c3676b62fb47243e0d357c87115b6f3395e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"13\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/3/ac36f76f1ead891f8047e7da5e6d2bfa8cc4008c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2y+3x=\\frac{xy}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"110\" height=\"34\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/c/5bc3ae4d2c252d5359341515b21da8295b35f55d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4y+6x=xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"104\" height=\"16\" />. From this, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/7/e87001367b3d05205ee8f3f95a672b4a9e8d4083.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4y=xy-6x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"104\" height=\"16\" />. We can factor an <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> out of the RHS, and so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/7/4c7c5714a634cc18304c072c079e6a5a8ec3ef34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4y=x(y-6)\\implies \\frac{4y}{y-6}=x, \\boxed{\\text{D}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"269\" height=\"40\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME\" title=\"1974 AHSME\">1974 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1974 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1974\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem